{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52925","headline":"诗 一 · 寒山","name":"诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵志死去来，魂识（《天圣广灯录》作「魄」）见阎老。\n读尽百王书，未免（《天圣广灯录》作「不兑」）受捶拷。\n一称南无佛，皆以成佛道。\n（见《续藏经》本五代风穴延沼禅师《风穴语录》、《天圣广灯录》卷十五、《古尊宿语录》卷七《风穴禅师语录》、《五灯会元》卷十一引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}